    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλί̆κ-ωψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωπος</span>,
